OL,5,G0232 Health Check
OL,6,     FSome people are injecting a
OL,7,     Ffraction of the standard dose of
OL,8,     Fweight loss drugs and hoping to
OL,9,     Fstill receive the benefits, but
OL,10,     Fmany are doing so without any
OL,11,     Fmedical oversight.
